      "want": "D",
      "got": "D",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "An ideal solution has no intermolecular interactions between different molecules that differ from the interactions between identical molecules, so the enthalpy of mixing is zero and the volume change is zero. This means the potential energy of the mixture is the same as the sum of the potential energies of the individual components.\n\nAnswer: (D)"
