      "want": "C",
      "got": "B",
      "ok": false,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "The correct answer is (B).\n\n1) Larmor frequency: ω = γ·B0 = 65.82e8·B0.\n2) Pulse condition: γ·B1·t = π/2 → B1 = π/(γ·t).\n3) B1 = 3.14159 / (6.582e8·1e-6) ≈ 25.7 mT.\n\nAnswer: (B)"
