      "want": "B",
      "got": "B",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "(B)\n\n1) Number of half-lives: n = t/T½ = 24/6 = 4.\n2) Remaining activity: A = A0·(1/2)^n = 150·(1/2)^4 = 150/16 = 9.375 mCi.\n3) Rounding to two decimal places: 9.4 mCi.\n\nAnswer: (B)"
