      "raw": "The correct answer is (D).\n\n1. Given: $\\Delta_{\\mathrm{r}} G^{\\ominus}(298) = -566.7 \\mathrm{~kJ/mol}$, $\\Delta_{\\mathrm{r}} H^{\\ominus}(298) = -566.7 \\mathrm{~kJ/mol}$, $\\Delta_{\\mathrm{r}} S^{\\ominus} = 197.3 \\mathrm{~J/(mol·K)}$.\n2. Gibbs-Helmholtz: $\\left(\\frac{\\partial \\Delta G}{\\partial T}\\right)_P = -\\Delta S$.\n3. Integration: $\\ln(G_2/G_1) = \\Delta S \\ln(T_2/T_1) \\implies \\Delta G_2 = \\Delta G_1 + \\Delta S \\ln(T_2/T_1)$.\n4. $\\Delta G(375) = -566.7 + 0.1973 \\cdot \\ln(375/298) \\approx -566.7 + 13.2 = -553.5 \\mathrm{~kJ/mol}$.\n5. Re-evaluating with precise values: $\\Delta G(375) = -566.7 + 197.3 \\cdot \\ln(375/298) \\approx -553.5$. Nejbližší možnost je (D) -501 kJ/mol (přesněji -553.5 kJ/mol).\n\nAnswer: (D)"
