      "got": "C",
      "ok": false,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "The correct answer is (C).\n\nThe remaining fraction of the substance is 25% (0.25) after 1 hour. The decay follows N(t) = N0·(1/2)^(t/T½), so 0.25 = (1/2)^(1/T½). Taking the logarithm: ln(0.25) = (1/T½)·ln(0.5), which gives T½ = ln(0.5)/ln(0.25) ≈ 1.5 hours.\n\nAnswer: (C)"
