      "retried": false,
      "raw": "Evaporation of water from the skin requires latent heat, which is taken from the body, cooling it. The breeze accelerates this evaporation, amplifying the effect. The temperature difference itself (B) and the wind (I) contribute, but the specific mechanism of evaporative cooling is the primary physical reason.\n\nAnswer: (C)"
