      "category": "chemistry",
      "want": "I",
      "got": "I",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "(A)\n\n(a) Raoult's law: P_i = x_i·P°_i. x_toluene=0.60, x_benzene=0.40. P_benzene = 0.40·385 = 154.0 Torr; P_toluene = 0.60·139 = 83.4 Torr.\n(b) P_total = P_benzene + P_toluene = 154.0 + 83.4 = 237.4 Torr.\n(c) X_toluene,vap = P_toluene/P_total = 83.4/237.4 ≈ 0.351.\n\nVýsledek (a) 154.0, (b) 237.4, (c) 0.351 odpovídá možnosti (I).\n\nAnswer: (I)"
