      "category": "chemistry",
      "want": "C",
      "got": "E",
      "ok": false,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "The correct answer is (E).\n\n1. Melting: q1 = m·l = 32.04 g × 22.0 cal/g = 704.88 cal.\n2. Heating liquid: q2 = m·c·ΔT = 32.04 × 0.570 × (65 - (-98)) = 1884.12 cal.\n3. Vaporization: q3 = m·ΔH_vap = 32.04 × 263 = 8430.72 cal.\nTotal = q1+q2+q3 = 10999.72 cal ≈ 11.00 Kcal.\n\nAnswer: (E)"
