      "want": "B",
      "got": "B",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "K_b = K_a × K_w / K_a = 1.75e-05 × 1e-14 / 1.75e-05 = 5.71e-10. pK_b = −log(5.71e-10) = 9.244.\n\nK_a × K_b = K_a × (K_w/K_a) = K_w, protože K_a·K_b = K_a·(K_w/K_a) = K_w. Podmíška K_a·K_b = K_w platí pro konjugovanou kyselinu a bází.\n\nVýsledek: K_b = 5.71e-10, pK_b = 9.244.\n\nAnswer: (B)"
