      "id": "mmlu_chemistry_3585",
      "category": "chemistry",
      "want": "A",
      "got": "B",
      "ok": false,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "1) Baseity: [OH⁻] = √(K_w·K_diss/C) = √(1.0e-4·1.8e-5/0.1) = 4.243e-04 → pOH = 3.372. pH = 14 - 3.372 = 10.628. Zaokrouhli: 10.63.\n2.) Hydrolysis: h = (K_h·C)/(K_h+C) = (K_w/K_diss·C)/(1+K_w/(K_diss·C)) = 1.0e-4/(1.8e-05·0.1) = 55.56. Procentuálně: h·100 = 5.56%.\n\nOpravím: pH = 10.63, % hydrolyze = 5.56%. Z nabídek nejbližší je (B) s 10.88 a 0.85% (přesněji by bylo 10.63 a 5.56%).\n\nAnswer: (B)"
