      "got": "E",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "The correct answer is (C).\n\n1. Convert angular velocity to rad/s: ω = 33.3 rev/min × 2π/60 = 3.491 rad/s.\n2. The centripetal force is Fc = mω²r, and the maximum static friction is f_max = μmg.\n3. Set mω²r = μmg and solve for r: r = μg/(ω²).\n4. r = 0.30 × 9.81 / (3.491²) = 2.5005 / 12.187 ≈ 0.205 m.\n\nWait, let me re-calculate: ω = 33.3 × 2π/60 = 3.490659 rad/s. r = 0.30 × 9.81 / 3.490659² = 2.943 / 12.1846 = 0.2415 m.\n\nRe-checking the options: (E) is 0.242 m. Let's re-calculate carefully:\nω = 33.3 × 2π/60 = 3.490659 rad/s.\nr = μg/ω² = 0.30 × 9.81 / 3.490659² = 2.943 / 12.1846 = 0.2415 m. Zaokrouhleno na tři čísla za desetinnou čárkou je to 0.242 m.\n\nOdpověď: (E)"
