    {
      "id": "mmlu_physics_9065",
      "category": "physics",
      "want": "B",
      "got": "E",
      "ok": false,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "The air in the pump is compressed adiabatically, so T2/T1 = (P2/P1)^(gamma/gamma-1). With P1=101.325 kPa (atmospheric), P2=24.5 lb/in² ≈ 169.27 kPa, and gamma=1.4, we get T2/300 = (169.27/101.325)^(1.4/0.4) ≈ 1.672. T2 = 300 × 1.672 ≈ 501.6 K. Zaokrouhli na nejbližší možnost.\n\nAnswer: (E)"
    },
    {
      "id": "mmlu_physics_9066",
      "category": "physics",
      "want": "B",
      "got": "B",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "(B)\n\ng = GM/g = G(4/3πρR³)/R² = 4πGρR/3. Setting g_planet = g_earth: 4πGρ_p R_p/3 = 4πGρ_e R_e/3, odkud R_p/R_e = ρ_e/ρ_p. Protože ρ_p = 2ρ_e, dostaneme R_p = R_e/2 = 6.378e+06/2 ≈ 3.189e+06 m. Zaokrouhli na 3.19 × 10^6 m.\n\nAnswer: (B)"
    },
    {
