      "want": "B",
      "got": "B",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "The correct answer is (B).\n\n1) Acceleration: a = qE/m = (1.6e-19·E)/9.11e-31.\n2) Displacement: x = ½at² = ½(qE/m)t² → E = 2m·x/(q·t²).\n3) E = 2·9.11e-31·0.1/(1.6e-19·1e-14) ≈ 3.803e-03 statV/cm.\n4) Potential difference: V = E·d = 3.803e-03·10 = 3.803e-02 V (in SI) = 11.4 V (in statV).\n\nAnswer: (B)"
