      "category": "physics",
      "want": "D",
      "got": "C",
      "ok": false,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "The correct answer is (C).\n\n1. Mass of Earth: M = ρV = 5.5e3 × (4/3)π(6.4e6)^3 ≈ 9.225e24 kg.\n2. Acceleration at surface: g = GM/r^2 = 9.81 m/s^2.\n3. Solve for G: G = g·r^2/M = 9.81 × (6.4e6)^2 / 9.225e24 ≈ 6.674e-11 N·m^2/kg^2.\n4. Rounding to two significant figures: 6.7 × 10^-10 Nm^2/kg^2.\n\nAnswer: (C)"
