      "category": "physics",
      "want": "F",
      "got": "F",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "The correct answer is (A).\n\n1) Conversion formula: C = (F − 32) × 5/9.\n2) C = (68 − 32) × 5/9 = 36 × 5/9 = 20.0.\n3) Rounding to the nearest integer gives 20, but let's recheck the options.\n\nWait, 68°F is exactly 20°C. Let me re-calculate: (68-32)*5/9 = 36*5/9 = 20.0.\n\nLooking at the options: (A) 21, (B) 16, (C) 22, (D) 25, (E) 24, (F) 20, (G) 23, (H) 19, (I) 26, (J) 18.\n\nOption (F) is 20°C. Let me re-read the question. Oh, I misread my own scratchpad. 68°F is exactly 20°C.\n\nLet's re-calculate: (68-32)*5/9 = 36*5/9 = 20.0.\n\nOption (F) is 20°C.\n\nWait, I wrote (A) at the start. Let me re-check. (68-32)*5/9 = 20.0. Option (F) is 20.\n\nLet me re-read the options again: (A) 21, (B) 16, (C) 22, (D) 25, (E) 24, (F) 20, (G) 23, (H) 19, (I) 26, (J) 18.\n\nYes, (F) is 20.\n\nLet me re-calculate one more time: 68 - 32 = 36. 36 * 5 = 180. 180 / 9 = 20.\n\nSo the answer is (F).\n\nAnswer: (F)"
