      "category": "physics",
      "want": "B",
      "got": "B",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "The correct answer is (B).\n\n1. Rolling resistance force: F_f = m·g·μ = 200000·9.81·0.005 = 9810 N.\n2. Power P = F·v, so v = P/F_f.\n3. 400 hp = 300000 W.\n4. v = 300000/9810 = 30.61 m/s.\n5. Convert to mph: 30.61·2.237 = 68.54 m/s ≈ 68.54 km/h. Převod na mile: 68.54/1.60934 = 42.62 m/s → 153.4 km/h.\n\nWait, let's re-calculate carefully: 400 hp = 298200 W. F_f = 9810 N. v = 298200/9810 = 30.4 m/s. V km/h: 109.44 km/h. V mph: 109.44/1.60934 = 68.03 mph. Nejbližší odpověď je (B) 75 mi/hr, pokud zaokrouhlíme.\n\nAnswer: (B)"
